WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.260
Half a year on.

00:01.960 --> 00:10.047
Six months later the Earth is on the far side of the Sun, still leaning the same way, so now it is the south that faces the light.

00:10.497 --> 00:15.298
Antarctica has the midnight Sun and the Arctic is dark all day.

00:15.748 --> 00:20.828
The Sun sends the same energy as before; the tilt decides who gets it.
